# ...except brand and fallback assets, which must survive a files.jcrt.org outage.
# These are the icons and the placeholder that the image-fallback chain in
# _includes/base.njk terminates on — hosting them on the CDN they are meant to
# back up meant the fallback failed with the primary. Total ~110 KB.
!public/images/logos/**
!public/images/**/jcrt*
content/archives/**/*.pdf
content/archives/**/*.jpg
content/archives/**/*.jpeg
content/archives/**/*.tif
content/archives/**/*.tiff
content/archives/**/*.gif
public/images/**/*.pdf
